        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji inendet, Kama obe ak muguleldanyu ye kaweeksei chichigai eng’ karinnyi kotorogun? Tos betusiechu ko che kitaage feda, ak ketaage ngoroik, ak mbarenikab emitik, ak mbarenikab sabibuk, ak kechirek ak tuga, ak otwogik che murenik ak che tibik? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
